    @CleanupRestoreNetwork
    Scenario Outline: Unsubscribe requests during network failure result in client error
        Given HeadlessApp subscribe the sensor signal <path> which is initialized <value> of datatype <datatype>
        When network failure of <network_failure> is injected
        Then attempts to unsubscribe the subscription to <path> of <datatype> are failed

    Examples:
        | path                                          | network_failure | datatype  | value     |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.ABS.IsEnabled | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.ABS.IsEnabled | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.ABS.IsEngaged | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.ABS.IsEngaged | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.ActiveAutonomyLevel | reject  | string | SAE_1 |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.ActiveAutonomyLevel | timeout | string | SAE_1 |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.AdaptiveDistanceSet | reject  | float | 1.70141175e+38 |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.AdaptiveDistanceSet | timeout | float | 1.70141175e+38 |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.AdaptiveIntervalSet | reject  | string | INTVL_2 |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.AdaptiveIntervalSet | timeout | string | INTVL_2 |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.DegradationStatus | reject  | string | CONTAMINATION |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.DegradationStatus | timeout | string | CONTAMINATION |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.IsActive | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.IsActive | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.IsAdaptive | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.IsAdaptive | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.IsEnabled | reject  | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.IsEnabled | timeout | bool | false |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.SpeedSet | reject  | float | 0.0 |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.CruiseControl.SpeedSet | timeout | float | 0.0 |
        | Vehicle.ADAS.DMS.DegradationStatus | reject  | string | CAMERA_LENS_CONTAMINATION |
